IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-PHOTONIC.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-ADAPTERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 OPTICAL-LANES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 WAVELENGTH-BANKS    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PW-MESH.
    IF NUM-ADAPTERS == 0 OR OPTICAL-LANES == 0 OR WAVELENGTH-BANKS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 168400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-ADAPTERS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
